<title>GERMANY: Ymos sells domestic locking unit to LTD.</title>
<headline>Ymos sells domestic locking unit to LTD.</headline>
<dateline>OBERTSHAUSEN, Germany 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>German industrial group Ymos AG said on Monday it had sold its domestic locking systems operations, which account for some two percent of its sales, to LTD Locking Technologies and Devices GmbH.</p>
<p>The sell-off follows Ymos's sale last year of its larger motor locking systems division to Valeo of France.</p>
<p>In a statement, Ymos said the domestic locking division had annual sales of some 20 million marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
